EXPLAIN
TAG	CV
TITLE	LABEL	Cyclic Voltammetry - derived middle cycles	Test Identifier
DATE	LABEL	10/26/2026	Date
TIME	LABEL	16:34:00	Time
NOTES	NOTES	10	Notes
	Derived data from the named source file; not a new potentiostat acquisition.
	Retained original cycles 2 and 3 only. Export CURVE1 maps to source CURVE2; CURVE2 maps to source CURVE3.
	Im processing: per-branch Hampel median replacement, window 11 points, threshold 3*1.4826*MAD; numerical floor 1e-6 nA.
	Then local quadratic Savitzky-Golay, window 21 points for source cycle 2, 25 points for source cycle 3; order 2, shifted endpoint windows.
	Cycles and forward/reverse sweep branches processed independently; no cross-branch averaging.
	Only Im is changed. Original Pt, time, measured potential, signal, range and status columns are preserved.
	Original acquisition had 4 programmed cycles. CYCLES=2 below denotes the two exported cycles.
	Source SHA256: 5b47a69aca2657394d6e05d027ba0db73a55d0fa4e7c565fe083abb1f9ae4ee0
	Source file: /Volumes/home/Thayer/ENGS127_Lab2/Test/New_Probe_2/Au_CV.DTA
	Other acquisition metadata below are copied from the source and do not imply a new acquisition or independent calibration.
